\begin{cases}
y_t = a_1 y_{t-1} + b_1 x_{t-1} + \epsilon_{1t} \\
x_t = a_2 x_{t-1} + b_2 y_{t-1} + c_2 x_{t-2} + d_2 y_{t-2} + \epsilon_{2t}
\end{cases}
\]

- **Bidirectional feedback** requires:
